Z||000001||DXR_DAD||07-27-2001||11:02 AM||||Here's the info: <A HREF="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002562.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.fiero.nl/forum/Archives/Archive-000002/HTML/20010116-1-002562.html</A> <P><BR>Two set of tail lights? Remove the covers, take the clear/white lens out, cut the red lens to the size of the clear/white lens.<P>Put them back together with all RED!!! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>You do need to change the back up bulbs to a brighter bulb, I can't remember the # off hand??<P>DXR_DAD||||reg||3
